Description: GroupOffice groupware and CRM
 GroupOffice is a web based groupware and CRM application
 Take your office online. Share projects, calendars, files and e-mail online 
 with co-workers and clients. Easy to use and fully customizable, GroupOffice
 takes online collaboration to the next level.


